WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.598
Open Evangelism and record the date, location and number

00:00:05.598 --> 00:00:06.798
of people reached.

00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:09.756
Use Add a person when details need to be

00:00:09.756 --> 00:00:10.057
recorded.

00:00:10.307 --> 00:00:14.517
Confirm their agreement before keeping contact details for follow-up.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:18.038
Choose a worker and next contact date when another

00:00:18.038 --> 00:00:19.128
conversation is agreed.

00:00:19.378 --> 00:00:21.979
Select Save visit and wait for Visit saved.

00:00:22.229 --> 00:00:24.663
Continue from the follow-up list or board.

00:00:24.913 --> 00:00:27.964
If no worker is listed, ask the Pastor to

00:00:27.964 --> 00:00:29.320
check the worker assignment.
